          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "несправедливый (nespravedlívyy) is не- \"not\" in front of справедливый (spravedlívyy) \"fair\", which is usually traced to the root of право, Proto-Slavic pravŭ \"right, correct\" (EtymDB)."
