          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "разумный (razúmnyy) is built on разум \"reason\", which Russian borrowed from Church Slavonic; it comes from Proto-Slavic orzumŭ, built on umŭ \"mind\", the word that gives ум (EtymDB). The ра- at the start is the Church Slavonic shape where Russian also has роз-."
            }
          ]
        },
